      "review_record": "docs/decisions/ADR-062-CLASSIC-CONTENT-DISPOSITIONS-AND-BATCHES.md",
      "basis": "DRAFT W268 R038 / G6; not an owner decision. Date is preparation date only, not an attestation. Source SHA-256 ebcf3d56473362fb564df1440385cb9c53b7d26bbc6e8c6c456b8e966b361fbe. Proposed non-shipment of the old file; does not clear authorship, approve NEW art, or satisfy D7/V1. Keep project casing and NEW four-tier motor models. Exclusion would NOT resolve the shared LibVulpes authorship chain; reopening import needs ADR-061 section 4.1 per-file history and authorship evidence. Only three consumer lines bind AR's bundled copy: forcefieldprojector.json bottom and particle (lines 12-13), and vacuumlaser.json particle (line 13). The other 73 matching lines use libvulpes:blocks/machinegeneric from LibVulpes's own jar, not this AR copy; excluding it removes nothing they used and settles nothing about LibVulpes authorship."
