      "basis": "DRAFT W268 R090 / G4; not an owner decision. Date is preparation date only, not an attestation. Source SHA-256 79ce28db42f00c86f90f99140ac3be60168ed0fcaf69452445e1dad6bb1bb5f6. Proposed non-shipment of the old file; does not clear authorship, approve NEW art, or satisfy D7/V1. The 1.12 leather-armour suit could be dyed: tinted base layers and untinted overlay files, for icons and the worn suit. The modern NEW suit cannot be dyed; accepting G4 accepts that loss. Restoring dyeing needs NEW tintable layers, not these files. The old AUDIT-01 iron-armour placeholder observation is superseded."
